b 14:9","note":"yet through the scent of water it will bud, and sprout boughs like a plant.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Psalm 72:7","note":"In his days, the righteous shall flourish, and abundance of peace, until the moon is no more.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Proverbs 11:28","note":"He who trusts in his riches will fall, but the righteous shall flourish as the green leaf.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Song of Solomon 6:11","note":"I went down into the nut tree grove, to see the green plants of the valley, to see whether the vine budded, and the pomegranates were in flower.","source":"web"}],"related":[],"senses":[{"id":"H6524B","gloss":"to break out","relation":"H6524B ="},{"id":"H6524C","gloss":"to fly","relation":"H6524C ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}